WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.730
<b>Be careful! We'll need those to fight!</b>

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.480
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.530
<b>Okay then. Please sign on the dotted line.</b>

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.280
<b>The western half of the hill will be used to bury</b>

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.080
<b>the fallen Navarre soldiers, with the dead Stormtroops on the eastern half.</b>

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:19.950
<b>That'll be fine.</b>

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.750
<b>You can use the things I'm not taking with me as you wish.</b>

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.010
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.090
<b>The suits of armor from the dead
Navarre soldiers will fetch a tidy sum.</b>

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:29.920
<b>Probably.</b>

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.220
<b>I'll make good use of the money.</b>

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.970
<b>Can we really not convince you to fight alongside us?</b>

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:40.220
<b>With us gone, Brune's western
borders are basically unprotected.</b>

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.270
<b>We'll have to get back soon.</b>

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.100
<b>Good hunting, Silver Meteor Stormtroops.</b>

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:50.780
<b>I'll leave for the capital.</b>

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:51.480
<b>Huh?</b>

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:54.820
<b>You need an audience with His Majesty. 
I'll get you one.</b>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:55.990
<b>It's too dangerous!</b>

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:58.240
<b>Even Sir Mashas was nearly killed for trying!</b>

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.580
<b>I'm a knight of Brune.</b>

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.250
<b>I must make amends for attacking you.</b>

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.380
<b>Your mind is set on this, isn't it?</b>

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.000
<b>By the way, what's keeping Elen?</b>

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.170
<b>I don't know.</b>

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:15.010
<b>Though we <i>did</i> get a surprise visit from a Regnitzian messenger.</b>

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:16.430
<b>I see.</b>

