00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:57.630
<b>Each bowman now has 56 arrows available.</b>

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.300
<b>I made sure all cavalrymen received a sling and 11 stones</b>

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.970
<b>while foot soldiers got 5.</b>

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:06.600
<b>But this won't last us through a single major battle.</b>

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:07.720
<b>Lack of supplies...</b>

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.760
<b>There's one other problem.</b>

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:13.350
<b>The Muozinellan force has taken our countrymen captive.</b>

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:17.650
<b>They could use them as shields, keeping us from attacking.</b>

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.360
<b>I know.</b>

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.070
<b>Set up camp for the night.</b>

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:24.990
<b>General, sir...</b>

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.530
<b>We spotted an enemy force.</b>

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.450
<b>It looks like Brunish soldiers.</b>

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:30.560
<b>How many?</b>

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:32.200
<b>Between one and two hundred.</b>

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.370
<b>Purely cavalry.</b>

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:38.130
<b>They're keeping their distance, 
pelting our left flank with stones and arrows.</b>

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.750
<b>Send three thousand infantrymen and eradicate them.</b>

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:44.520
<b>Isn't that far too many soldiers?</b>

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:46.130
<b>Wouldn't five hundred suffice?</b>

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:48.090
<b>Those cavalrymen are a decoy.</b>

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.470
<b>Go and hit their main force.</b>

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:50.140
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:54.520
<b>Two hundred men as bait indicates about two thousand in their main force.</b>

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.520
<b>Under orders from their supreme commander, Qasim,</b>

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:01.440
<b>a force of three thousand Muozinellan soldiers,</b>

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:06.360
<b>one third being bowmen and the rest spearmen, gives chase to the two hundred Brunish riders.</b>

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:10.120
<b>After passing through a narrow choke point, they arrive at a dead end.</b>

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:14.450
<b>There, the Muozinellan soldiers at the front see...</b>

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.460
<b>Their main force?!</b>

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.170
<b>There's five, no, six thousand of them!</b>

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:23.170
<b>Attack!</b>

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.930
<b>Retreat! Fall back!</b>

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.000
<b>We can't!</b>

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.310
<b>The rear soldiers keep pushing forward!</b>

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:46.690
<b>The first battle went well enough.</b>

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.160
<b>Collect all usable ammunition!</b>

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:07.760
<b>Tigre focused on setting up numerous small skirmishes 
in hopes of slowing down the Muozinellan army</b>

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:11.300
<b>and whittling away at their numbers.</b>

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.050
<b>After repeated sneak attacks,</b>

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:18.100
<b>the enemy twenty thousand were reduced to nineteen and finally eighteen thousand.</b>

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:21.440
<b>In response, Qasim...</b>

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:25.070
<b>Brunish cowards!</b>

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:30.150
<b>You worms! Always crawling on the ground and hiding behind rocks!</b>

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:36.830
<b>We won't put up with your petty tricks forever!</b>

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:40.000
<b>Since you won't reveal yourselves,</b>

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.500
<b>they're getting it!</b>

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:43.540
<b>Kill them!</b>

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.340
<b>Forward.</b>

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.630
<b>Forward!</b>

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:53.630
<b>That day, the Muozinellan commander
organized a unit three thousand strong</b>

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.470
<b>and positioned it ahead of the main force.</b>

00:15:56.470 --> 00:16:02.640
<b>Qasim assumed the enemy would never attack head-on given how outnumbered they were.</b>

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:07.400
<b>However, a contingent of the 
Silver Meteor Stormtroops showed up before him.</b>

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:09.150
<b>There were six hundred of them.</b>

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:17.450
<b>For a moment I thought they'd shown themselves, 
but it's only six hundred?</b>

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.160
<b>Which one is leading them?</b>

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:23.340
<b>It's probably the red-haired man standing right in front.</b>

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.090
<b>Impossible. Brunemen despise bows as cowardly.</b>

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.510
<b>They'd never make an archer their captain.</b>

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:31.800
<b>Is this another decoy?</b>

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:35.300
<b>Hear me, you crude, barbaric Muozinellan soldiers!</b>

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:41.100
<b>For taking the lives of innocent civilians you deserve to be put to the sword!</b>

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.060
<b>Say your prayers!</b>

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.480
<b>Shoot him once he gets into range.</b>

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:54.150
<b>Another ambush? What a one-trick pony...</b>

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.310
<b>The Zhctedian army?!</b>

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:00.080
<b>Impossible!</b>

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.180
<b>Charge!</b>

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:02.620
<b>Charge them!</b>

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.210
<b>There goes our chance of charging them first.</b>

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.960
<b>Then again, there's not even two thousand of them.</b>

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:13.130
<b>Parlor tricks won't help them defeat our advance unit.</b>

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:22.060
<b>He's getting ahead of himself.</b>

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:24.020
<b>There's three hundred alsins between us.</b>

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.230
<b>No one can shoot that—</b>

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:26.230
<b>Lord Qasim!</b>

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:28.940
<b>Lord Qasim has been shot!</b>

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.480
<b>Impossible! From where?!</b>

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:35.950
<b>Count Tigrevurmud Vorn has felled the enemy's supreme commander!</b>

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:40.780
<b>All units, give chase!</b>

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:42.490
<b>Don't let a single one escape!</b>

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.790
<b>We've cut it closer than I'd thought.</b>

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.580
<b>They got careless.</b>

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.880
<b>That's why I wanted to confront them with our main force.</b>

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.260
<b>I bet he never would've guessed a country known for its contempt of bowmen</b>

00:17:54.260 --> 00:18:01.140
<b>would have an archer who could hit a target from over three hundred alsins away.</b>

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.850
<b>They're fleeing back to Muozinel.</b>

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:07.270
<b>Rurick, could you handle the pursuit?</b>

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.150
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:23.080
<b>Why didn't you attack sooner?</b>

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:27.960
<b>Why didn't you show yourselves this morning? You could have, couldn't you?!</b>

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:29.620
<b>You were watching, weren't you?</b>

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:33.060
<b>If you had shown yourself, they would still be alive!</b>

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.510
<b>And yet...</b>

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.100
<b>You little—</b>

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:44.390
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:51.060
<b>Excuse me.</b>

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.280
<b>Thank you very much for saving us.</b>

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.410
<b>And for...</b>

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.450
<b>avenging my father's death on the same day.</b>

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:13.880
<b>Don't take this the wrong way.</b>

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:19.420
<b>You see, that man wasn't wrong, but...</b>

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:23.720
<b>still, I wanted to thank you.</b>

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.110
<b>No, I should be the one thanking you.</b>

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:46.870
<b>During this battle, the Muozinellan army lost over three thousand men.</b>

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:51.120
<b>Combined with the prior battles,
the death toll topped five thousand.</b>

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:56.500
<b>In other words, a quarter of the Muozinellan invaders never returned from Agnes.</b>

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:06.790
<b>1503 of us made it out alive.</b>

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:12.230
<b>Among those, there's 462 injured, some of them gravely.</b>

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.900
<b>Considering what we were up against, it's a miraculous outcome.</b>

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.860
<b>What about the 2000 slaves we freed?</b>

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.570
<b>We've got no choice but to send them to Territoire.</b>

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:22.780
<b>There's no other way.</b>

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:26.160
<b>Sir Tigrevurmud...</b>

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:27.820
<b>May I have a word?</b>

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:30.040
<b>An advance party?!</b>

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:33.750
<b>The Muozinellan prisoners all said the same thing:</b>

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.040
<b>"We are just the beginning."</b>

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:40.510
<b>If that was the vanguard,
how many more will be coming?</b>

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:41.920
<b>Supposedly thirty thousand.</b>

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.630
<b>Thirty thousand...</b>

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:48.430
<b>They won't immediately be able to join up with the ones who've escaped us.</b>

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:52.930
<b>But in only a few days we should expect to face roughly forty thousand Muozinelians.</b>

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:56.690
<b>All the fighting took a toll on our men.</b>

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.690
<b>And we've got to take care of the civilians too.</b>

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.880
<b>I thought I had prepared for the worst, but this tops it.</b>

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:16.000
<b>We're not even half as far as I had planned.</b>

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.630
<b>It was inevitable we'd fall behind.</b>

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:21.710
<b>A unit of Muozinellan knights is charging this way.</b>

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:23.470
<b>There's between three and four thousand.</b>

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:25.340
<b>Looks like they're not taking any chances.</b>

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:26.680
<b>Take over here.</b>

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.090
<b>Be careful!</b>

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:33.180
<b><i>At least we can take potshots.</i></b>

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:35.130
<b><i>The wind's in our favor.</i></b>

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:48.070
<b>They're not even slowing down.</b>

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:49.120
<b>At this rate...</b>

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:52.310
<b>Enemy reinforcements?</b>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.170
<b>No, that flag—</b>

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:02.150
<b>Olmütz's Snow Princess of the Frozen Ripple...</b>

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:04.780
<b>Ludmila Lourie!</b>

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:08.600
<b>Long time no see, Count Tigrevurmud Vorn.</b>

